{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The assorted heat shrink tubing fits my small electronics projects because I need to insulate wire connections, and several sizes would accommodate different wires.",
    "The compact six-inch caliper would help me check component dimensions and mounting clearances, connecting my electronics supplies with my occasional mechanical work."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Marine sealing kits, large-diameter tubing, and harness taps serve wiring tasks I have not shown a need for; working with small circuits does not mean I need those specialized connections.",
    "The specific threaded inserts and ten-pack of glue require a particular repair or quantity I do not currently need, while the drill brush does not support my current project interests."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in electronics seems to have been stretched into an interest in nearly any wire connector or insulation product, regardless of wire size or intended use.",
    "My caster purchase seems to have been treated as a broad reason to suggest workshop supplies, although it does not establish a need for particular fasteners or bulk adhesives."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My breadboards, relay, and PCB supplies point toward small component work, where suitable dimensions and flexible assortments matter more to me than marine or automotive features.",
    "I choose supplies for a concrete task: the smaller caliper and general tubing assortment fit my expected needs better than oversized tools, specialized kits, or large quantities."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my hands-on electronics interests but stretched them too far into specialized wiring and general workshop supplies."
}"}
